	<key>readme</key>
	<string>nq: opens the window. ↩ runs or stops a test, ⌘C copies the result, the dropdown filters history by network.
nqh: recent results in Alfred (type a network name to filter). ↩ copies, ⌘↩ opens the window.
Closing the window mid-test lets it finish; the result is saved and shown as a notification.
Grades (Poor/Okay/Great) use the thresholds in Configure Workflow.</string>
